%% vLLM Scheduler State Machine
%% Commit: 67745d189fd981ee824bde35666a3737a962c031

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> WAITING: New Request

    WAITING --> RUNNING: Scheduled<br/>(KV blocks allocated)

    RUNNING --> FINISHED_STOPPED: Stop token<br/>generated
    RUNNING --> FINISHED_LENGTH: Max tokens<br/>reached
    RUNNING --> FINISHED_ABORTED: Error or<br/>cancelled
    RUNNING --> PREEMPTED: Memory<br/>pressure

    PREEMPTED --> WAITING: Resources<br/>available

    FINISHED_STOPPED --> [*]
    FINISHED_LENGTH --> [*]
    FINISHED_ABORTED --> [*]

    note right of WAITING
        Request queued
        No KV blocks yet
        Priority-ordered
    end note

    note right of RUNNING
        KV blocks allocated
        Generating tokens
        In active batch
    end note

    note right of PREEMPTED
        KV cache swapped
        or discarded
        Awaiting reschedule
    end note
